('Fire Chains', 'chain_width', NULL, 8.0, 'yards', '13-elite-affixes proposes 3 yards, borrowed from Poison Enchanted. Held at the current 8 because chain width is blocked on pack separation (decisions.md 2026-09-08) and Codex owns pack movement. Set it to 3 once packs stand apart.'),
